 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2009-04-01",
   "text": "Social Security Forever Act of 2009 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to impose on employers, employees, and self-employed individuals an additional employment tax for wages in excess of the social security contribution and benefit base. \n Requires all Treasury securities to bear a facsimile of the signatures of the President and the Secretary of the Treasury."
  }
